    <subfield code="a">Contains 17 haiku by Stephen Addiss produced by cutting his own poems into individual lines and reassembling them into new poems. Each page has burn and smoke marks. The placement of the burns is based on a sequence of randomized numbers originally created by for a project by John Cage and Stephen Addiss.</subfield>
  </datafield>
